===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|markaðr}}, {{m|non|marknaðr||market}}, from northern {{der|is|fro|markiet}}, from {{der|is|fro|marchié}}, from {{der|is|la|mercātus||market}}. Cognate with {{cog|fo|marknaður}}, {{cog|da|marked}}, {{cog|nb|marked}}, {{cog|sv|marknad}}.

